"}]},{"client_msg_id":"284ca349-d86a-4f62-ad37-6df1bc0fc367","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"map - reduce な感じのパターンとも違う感じか。","ts":"1631615064.056900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CWAgb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bb1efd6-82ce-4655-a7ae-989c164e31a5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ジョブのキューを提供するサービスが必要っぽい\nここらへんを探して構成の参考にする?","ts":"1631615000.054700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Of"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90df3b8b-29d6-4f41-8cb9-a840433bd064","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"次に何を処理するべきか、問い合わせたら教えてくれるサーバーみたいなのを立ち上げたら良いかなと思ったのですが","ts":"1631614814.053200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=TPc2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3d79cd1-71bd-43cd-9bba-ade39b24de72","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"そういうイメージですね\n処理順を制御するプログラムを書きたいんですがどうするのがよいかという質問です","ts":"1631614774.052000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Vxko"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fd8b306-bac8-4a9f-a8c3-15a7540a0f90","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"とりあえず動いてるんですが、たまに同時に同じファイルを処理してしまったり、優先順位をもっと柔軟につけたいとかの不満があるので代替案を探してます","ts":"1631614733.051000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xLlK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d7e313f-254e-490f-8caa-0466a7bfcc06","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"キュー・ワーカー？","ts":"1631614688.049800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wr5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25b888fb-0b71-4d9f-bd28-e3823371ae6d","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"質問です。\n\n複数マシンに同じ環境を準備して同じプロセスWを複数走らせて、この状況でW間の同期を取りたいです。\n同期というか処理内容を決める感じなので通信はたまにです（同期処理の時間は速くなくてok）（同期って呼んでますが適切な単語があったら教えて下さい）\n各Wは似た処理をこなしていくもので、W間の通信は不要、単体で完結しています\nいまのところは処理内容を記述したファイルを作成して、定期的にファイル置き場を確認して→未処理のものがあれば処理する、というループを書きました（このプログラムを沢山立ち上げた）","ts":"1631614649.048600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uUxv5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a55b53eb-763b-449f-80fc-e18e101b1168","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"グローバルに排他処理は理解としておかしかった。\nmkdirすると、フォルダがあるとき失敗するからか。\n\u003chttp://x68000.q-e-d.net/~68user/webcgi/lock.html\u003e","ts":"1631616431.090900","thread_ts":"1631615290.063100","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jlq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3f2f0b7-d497-48fe-9522-4f0243ab8b40","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ロック確認と生成を1手でやらないと他プロセスに割り込まれる可能性がある","ts":"1631616456.091900","thread_ts":"1631615290.063100","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"66EBw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87b1d704-ab13-496c-8213-756773770d07","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"これに近いことやってますが、IOが前後する時があるのかな\n被るときがあります","ts":"1631615300.063300","thread_ts":"1631615262.062800","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pD6"}]}]
